# 群消息总结 · 类图（技术方案-群消息总结-2026-11-20.md 第 ④ 节源码）
classDiagram
    class Database {
        +insert_group_summary(...) dict
        +list_group_summaries(page, page_size, session, date) (int, list)
        +get_group_summary(id) dict?
        +delete_group_summary(id) int
        +insert_ai_usage(...) int
        +_PURGE_TABLES: tuple
    }
    note for Database "_PURGE_TABLES 含 group_summaries：手动 purge 白名单，非自动清理"
    class WeChatService {
        +get_messages_in_range(username, start_epoch, end_epoch, limit) (list, str)
        -_resolve_row_sender(username, content, fallback_wxid, sender_id) (str, str)
        +resolve_group_member_display(chatroom, member_id) str
    }
    class WeChatDB {
        +get_messages_between(user, start_ts, end_ts, limit) List~dict~
        +get_messages(user, limit, offset) List~dict~
    }
    class Billing {
        +get_billing_settings(db) dict
        +estimate_cost(pt, ct, billing) float
    }
    class SummaryService {
        -db: Database
        -wechat: WeChatService
        -client_factory: Callable
        +members(session, start, end, senders) dict
        +generate(session, start, end, senders, style, custom_prompt) dict
        -build_system_prompt(style, custom_prompt) str
        -build_corpus(msgs, senders) (str, dict)
        -check_budget(stats) dict
        -parse_summary_json(text) dict
        +render_txt(row) str
        +render_html(row) str
    }
    class SummaryOverBudgetError
    class SummaryScheduler {
        +start() void
        -tick() void
    }
    class AIClient {
        +chat(system_prompt, user_message) str
        +last_usage: dict?
    }
    class RouterSummary {
        +GET /api/summary/members
        +POST /api/summary/generate
        +GET /api/summary/history
        +GET /api/summary/history/{id}
        +DELETE /api/summary/history/{id}
        +GET /api/summary/history/{id}/export
        +GET /api/summary/settings
        +PUT /api/summary/settings
    }
    SummaryService --> Database : 落库/用量
    SummaryService --> WeChatService : 取消息/取名链
    SummaryService --> Billing : 预算换算(与账单同公式)
    SummaryService --> AIClient : client_factory 构造并调用
    WeChatService --> WeChatDB : get_messages_between
    WeChatService ..> Database : group_cards/voice_texts 缓存
    RouterSummary ..> SummaryService : deps.get_summary_service()
    RouterSummary --> Database : get_db()
    SummaryService ..> SummaryOverBudgetError : 超预算(block)抛出→413
    SummaryScheduler ..> SummaryService : 定时 generate()
